setWorkflowSelectors
  ├── when the caller does not have the CONFIG_OPERATOR_ROLE
  │   └── it should revert
  ├── when called with a single selector
  │   ├── when isAllowlisted is true
  │   │   ├── it should set the selector as allowlisted
  │   │   └── it should emit a WorkflowSelectorSet event
  │   └── when isAllowlisted is false
  │       ├── it should remove the selector from the allowlist
  │       └── it should emit a WorkflowSelectorSet event
  └── when called with multiple selectors
      └── it should set all selectors
